       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PVSUM.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TBL.
          05 ITEM PIC 9(3) OCCURS 5 TIMES.
       01 I     PIC 9.
       01 TOTAL PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 5
               COMPUTE ITEM(I) = I * 10
               ADD ITEM(I) TO TOTAL
           END-PERFORM
           DISPLAY "TOTAL = " TOTAL
           STOP RUN.
